=== ch5_intro ===
Late summer, and the talk is as thick as the grass.
-> END

=== ch5_whisper ===
Echo has heard something unkind about Krit, and Echo is a very good listener.
-> END

=== ch5_bet ===
By the end, how much of the village will believe it?
-> END

=== ch5_hurt ===
The valley believes it now, and Krit, who never heard a word of it, is the one who pays.
Krit's diary remembers last winter, if you want to read it.
-> END

=== ch5_close_call ===
The rumor is out there, but it has not taken hold yet.
-> END
